		{"id":"4f947e8da7a2e44d","type":"text","text":"## Tirok\n\nBorn October 11th, 1981\n\nInventor + knows some science\n\nSecond most intelligent person on Earth","x":895,"y":-2275,"width":240,"height":240},
		{"id":"49cf66a59ac11bcd","type":"text","text":"## Loroc\n\nArrived on earth as an infant September 11th 2001\n\nThe most powerful Pomin on Earth\n\nCaused this Earth's 9/11.\nCrashing into the T-Industries 2nd Corporation building.\n\nMute. Speaks nothing.\nDrawing is his communication method.\n\nDeadset on being a hero / savior.","x":895,"y":-2002,"width":240,"height":442},
		{"id":"a9e9d0bf59245a6d","type":"text","text":"## Lex's science and tech works are popular for (mostly) being cheap enough to be in the realm of possibility of purchasing and using for the average citizen.\n\nBut some of Lex's creations are using unstable elements.\nLex knows that but doesn't care.\n\nThey can kill their users or just badly hurt them.\nPoison them.\n\nIn 2211 Epoch 1 Chapter 2 for example, Kaven Varlet is using Lex Breaker's tech and it's poisoning him.","x":600,"y":-1406,"width":590,"height":335},
		{"id":"ba0bd563eb7e47d5","type":"text","text":"## Lex Breaker has a big ego.\n\nHe feels like the best.\n\nBut these special people.\nThese Pomins are terrible for his ego.\n\nThey make him feel bad. And that's his motivation for going after and killing Pomins. And specifically targeting Loroc.","x":20,"y":-843,"width":602,"height":262},
		{"id":"bed1e685950c801c","type":"text","text":"## Lex Breaker Science Corporation\n\nEstablished 2002\n\nMost popular and successful science business\n2nd most popular and successful tech business","x":20,"y":-1065,"width":400,"height":163},
